Before using these permissions to undertake an activity that creates a
Research Model, You must expressly accept the Research Model Terms. A
recipient must do so before receiving a Research Model under section 7.3.
"Research Model Terms" means sections 1, 2.2, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, and 12
insofar as they apply to Research Models. This collective name includes the
applicable patent permissions as well as acceptance, use, citation,
transfer, ownership, commercial-authorization, warranty, liability,
termination, general, and dispute provisions. It does not expand the scope
of any intellectual-property permission. Where a model includes Software or
Modifications, sections 2.1 and 3 also apply to those included materials.

Acceptance must be evidenced by an affirmative electronic acknowledgment, a
signed statement, or another provable express agreement identifying RSSNet
