For executable distributions, provide the license and notices in
accompanying documentation or another readily accessible location. This
license does not require you to distribute your private Modifications or to
provide source code when distributing executables. Any separate obligations
for third-party components remain applicable.

Each recipient receives permission in the original Software directly from
